# PREVENTION, PROTECTION AND RECOVERY OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN AS VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE IN INDRAMAYU REGENCY

REGIONAL GAZETTE

INDRAMAYU REGENCY

NUMBER: 18 YEAR 2012

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF INDRAMAYU REGENCY

NUMBER 18 YEAR 2012

CONCERNING

PREVENTION, PROTECTION AND RECOVERY OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN AS VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE IN INDRAMAYU REGENCY

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF INDRAMAYU,

Considering:







a. that violence against women and children is an act that violates the rights and dignity of women and children as human beings;
b. that the implementation of prevention, protection and recovery of women and children as victims of violence in Indramayu Regency has not been carried out optimally;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b above, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on Prevention, Protection and Recovery of Women and Children as Victims of Violence in Indramayu Regency.

In View of:







1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 14 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas within the Province of West Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1950) as amended by Law Number 4 Year 1968 concerning the Establishment of Purwakarta Regency and Subang Regency by Amending Law Number 14 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas within the Province of West Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1968 Number 31, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2851);
3. Law Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3668);
4. Law Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
5. Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 169, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235);
6. Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
7. Law Number 32 Year 2004 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 125, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4437) as amended for the second time by Law Number 12 Year 2008 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 32 Year 2004 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2008 Number 59, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4844);
8. Government Regulation Number 4 Year 2006 concerning Implementation and Cooperation for Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604);
9. Government Regulation Number 38 Year 2007 concerning Division of Government Affairs Between the Government, Provincial Regional Government, and Regency/Municipal Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4737);
10. Government Regulation Number 41 Year 2007 concerning Regional Apparatus Organization (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 89, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4741);
11. Government Regulation Number 9 Year 2008 concerning Procedures and Mechanisms for Integrated Services for Witnesses and/or Victims of Criminal Acts of Human Trafficking (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2008 Number 22, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4818);
12. Regional Regulation of Indramayu Regency Number 7 Year 2008 concerning Regional Secretariat and DPRD Secretariat of Indramayu Regency (Regional Gazette of Indramayu Regency Year 2008 Number 7 Series D.3);
13. Regional Regulation of Indramayu Regency Number 8 Year 2008 concerning Regional Agencies of Indramayu Regency (Regional Gazette of Indramayu Regency Year 2008 Number 8 Series: D 4);
14. Regional Regulation of Indramayu Regency Number 9 Year 2008 concerning Regional Technical Institutions and Civil Service Police Unit of Indramayu Regency (Regional Gazette of Indramayu Regency Year 2008 Number 9 Series D.5) as amended for the second time by Regional Regulation of Indramayu Regency Number 16 Year 2012 concerning the Second Amendment to Regional Regulation of Indramayu Regency Number 9 Year 2008 concerning Regional Technical Institutions and Civil Service Police Unit of Indramayu Regency (Regional Gazette of Indramayu Regency Year 2012 Number 16).
15. Regional Regulation of Indramayu Regency Number 5 Year 2012 concerning Procedures for Establishing Regional Legal Products of Indramayu Regency (Regional Gazette of Indramayu Regency Number 5 Year 2012).

With Mutual Approval

REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF INDRAMAYU REGENCY

and

THE REGENT OF INDRAMAYU

HAS DECIDED:

To Establish:

REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING PREVENTION, PROTECTION AND RECOVERY OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN AS VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE IN INDRAMAYU REGENCY.
